# Regenerable outputs stay out of git. They are exported by the scripts beside them and handed to the owner outside
# the repository (C:\Users\Ishfaq\Project\orbit-marketing-assets: ads/in, ads/global, store/).
#   ads/out/       node marketing/ads/export.mjs
#   store/*.png    node marketing/screens/capture.mjs --store
#   screens/src/   node marketing/screens/capture.mjs (the raw captures; the website's WebP copies and the link
#                  previews are made from them, and those are committed where they're served)
ads/out/
store/*.png
screens/src/
